// Ch8 B02, in-engine insert 1, "Okeru!" (act1_ch08.md §2 B02; W04). On the wall-head among the
// Watchers' backs and the kite posts, a Stillguard drops his shield and hugs Toma hard enough to lift
// him: Ivo Brannick, Toma's shield-mate for seven years on this wall. Warm and loud. He kneels properly
// to Asha, takes to Rhen at once, eyes Liss's line-marks, then Toma's papers, then shrugs. Toma laughs
// out loud for the first time in the game (his laugh clip). Critical path: sets ch08_met_ivo (Ch9's
// side scene reads it).
// Do not surface: Ivo stood beside Toma at the 1003 Brine Shoals burning. Nothing of it is said here.
title: ch08_okeru
location: ch08/corrow
---
@camera W04
@sfx shield_dropped
@mark ivo ivo_hug run
@anim ivo hug_lift toma
Ivo [laugh]: Okeru! Level preserve us, they let you out of the village? You got fat on Haluna fish. #line:ch08_okeru_001
@anim toma laugh
Toma [laugh]: Put me down, Brannick. You'll crack the shield. #line:ch08_okeru_002
Ivo [smile]: Crack it? You still carry it like a tray of fish. #line:ch08_okeru_003
@mark ivo ivo_kneel walk
@anim ivo kneel_palms_flat
Ivo [tender]: Lady Cantor. Be level. #line:ch08_okeru_004
Asha [soft_smile]: And still, Ivo. He's told us nothing about you. #line:ch08_okeru_005
Ivo [laugh]: He wouldn't. Seven years on this wall and I got four words a month out of him. #line:ch08_okeru_006
@anim ivo look_at rhen
Ivo [smile]: And this one's the diver? Good shoulders. Stand on my left at the beacon-fire tonight and I'll teach you to drink. #line:ch08_okeru_007
Rhen [smile]: I'll hold you to that. #line:ch08_okeru_008
@anim ivo look_at liss
@wait 1.0
@anim ivo look_at toma
Toma [neutral]: She's on my papers. #line:ch08_okeru_009
@wait 0.6
Ivo [neutral]: Then she's on mine. #line:ch08_okeru_010
<<set $ch08_met_ivo = true>>
===
